{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1385403-fun-gadgets-for-extraordinary-citizens","id":1385403,"title":"Fun gadgets for extraordinary citizens!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-03T07:50:05-07:00","id":1385403,"title":"Fun gadgets for extraordinary citizens!","content":"In my games, I've been using a lot more charms/gadgets on mooks to make them feel a little more than just someone that can be taken out with three Arete successes, even if that is all they are.<br /> <br /> - Heal Stimpacks - Enlightenment 2, life 2 - Thanks to the popularity of instant healing in video games, the Progenitors have had an easier time adapting their medicines for field use. An injection will seal all wounds with clotted bloodcells, then properly restore injuries.<br /> <br /> - Photon Buster Flashbang - Enlightenment 3, forces 3 - A flashbang that converts light into a loud snap, rather than blinds. Useful for an escaping agent, or an agent who relies on something other than sight.<br /> <br /> - Stakeout Eats App - Enlightenment 2, data 2, entropy 2, primal utility 2 - The Syndicate and NWO have worked together to bring agents the Stakeout Eats App! For when a simple target tail mission turns into a stakeout, you can order a secure, safe and inconspicuous meal. Uses the local pool of Uber Eats, Skip the Dishes, and whatever other delivery services are around. Picks the best user to deliver a meal without selling you out, covers the cost and gives a big tip!<br /> <br /> What are some gadgets that you'd assign?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26088-actual_table","name":"Actual_Table","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26088_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-04T10:19:12-07:00","id":1385617,"title":"","content":"These gadgets all look pretty fun. The Stakeout Eats App is the one most likely to be coincidental and useful to Technocrats. I could even see Void Engineer 'ghostbusters' using it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}